/-- Corrected fixed-domain source-noise pair for Lemma 4.9.

The `A_hat_x(\tilde x_i)` component is evaluated by the fixed-domain oracle only
after `Algorithm43FixedDomainComplete` supplies the missing feasibility of the
generated extrapolate. This is a corrected non-original realization, not a
paper theorem assumption. -/
noncomputable def algorithm43FixedDomainDeltaOfComplete
    (T : ℕ) (hcomplete : setup.Algorithm43FixedDomainComplete T) :
    ℕ → Ω → SapdPrimalSpace n × SapdDualSpace m :=
  SOptLib.completedPartialProcessDelta T
    (fun i hi ω => setup.algorithm43FixedDomainStateOfComplete T i hcomplete hi ω)
    (fun st => st.x)
