from the totalized carrier oracle and a measurable ambient extrapolate.

This is a Lean-regularity theorem, not a fixed-domain SFO semantic claim: the
off-carrier branch is the `SOptLib.totalizeOn` zero branch.  Source-facing
proofs that need Eq. (4.4.6)'s literal oracle must still use a coverage or
realization lemma. -/
