/-- Corrected Eq. (4.4.72)--(4.4.73) envelope with an explicit primal
square-noise budget in place of the paper shorthand `sigmaX^2`. -/
private def GeneratedGapEq4472EnvelopeWithPrimalBudget
    (generatedAxSample : ℕ → Ω → SapdDualSpace m) (t : ℕ) (ht : 1 ≤ t)
