/-- Corrected stage-separated Eq. (4.4.72)--(4.4.73) boundary.

This is the boundary that is actually derivable from the current source-faithful
generated realization without a PDF-unstated same-sample independence hypothesis.
It contains the literal pathwise Eq. (4.4.72) canonical-`U_t` inequality and the
fresh-coordinate square-noise mean bound separately, because the latter is not a
pointwise replacement for the source `U_t` and cannot by itself justify the
