This intentionally adds the canonical `U_t` mean-control component that is not
derivable merely from the fresh-coordinate square-noise estimate.  Expected-gap
consumers must use this stronger boundary, while
`GeneratedGapEq4472Envelope_of_generated_oracle_realization_mixed_center` only
