/-- Integrability of the selected saddle-gap random variable in Theorem 4.8(a).

The generated stream is extension-only.  Its own descent envelope must be
derived from a source-realized oracle stream before this theorem is applicable;
measurability of an arbitrary stream is not enough. -/
theorem gap_generatedExtensionFeasibleOutput_integrable
    (generatedAxSample : ℕ → Ω → SapdDualSpace m) (t : ℕ) (ht : 1 ≤ t)
    (hstream : GeneratedAxStreamMeasurableUpTo generatedAxSample t)
    (hstep : GeneratedAxExtensionOneStepMeasurableUpTo setup generatedAxSample t)
    (henv : setup.GeneratedGapDescentEnvelope generatedAxSample t ht) :
