ambient gradient-Lipschitz regularity plus bounded Bregman diameter.

This is not used as evidence for Lan's unqualified source theorem: Eq. (4.4.2)
is represented by `hatf_smooth`, and `HatfGradientLipschitzOnX` is an explicit
internal predicate for corrected routes that need a deterministic APD mismatch
