above. The one-center SOptLib prox variational lemmas were considered but do
not match the source's convex `p` plus two weighted Bregman centers. -/
private theorem convex_bregman_two_center_residual_variational
    {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [CompleteSpace E]
    {X : Set E} {pFun : E → ℝ}
    (ν : SapdDistanceGeneratingFunction E X)
    {xHat xTilde yTilde u : E} {mu1 mu2 : ℝ}
    (hp_convex : ConvexOn ℝ X pFun)
