/-- Event-measurability obligation for Theorem 4.8(b)'s probability statement.

This is deliberately a derived theorem, not an assumption of the paper theorem:
the source states the probability bound without extra event-measurability
hypotheses. -/
private theorem sapd_high_probability_event_measurable_extension
    (generatedAxSample : ℕ → Ω → SapdDualSpace m)
    (t : ℕ) (ht : 1 ≤ t) (lambda : ℝ)
    (hstream : GeneratedAxStreamMeasurableUpTo generatedAxSample t)
